    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:4b5ff9b4a37f43cc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "962cebcbe61b4f5343185de5fcc446ed08b31a9e3b4517b5c767fb1bf2413c96",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Today, venture into the rainforest of the Chagres region for an immersive cultural experience with an Emberá indigenous community.\n\nTravel by traditional canoe through the lush rainforest, following the waterways that lead to the community and its natural surroundings. \n\nUpon arrival, discover the Emberá way of life and their deep connection with the forest. Learn about their traditions and ancestral knowledge through traditional music and dance, handicrafts, local cuisine and the use of medicinal plants. \n\nEnjoy a traditional lunch, included as part of the experience, before continuing with the cultural activities and spending time with the community. \n\nIn the afternoon, return by canoe and transfer back to Panama City.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1x3uuaoD0CVKvdDyFDQUVjWNvBPnH2nFF",
        "documentSha256": "c687cab36cc12bd7a608fc4fac85bbb0f2688469af3f424398ec10c8dcb86395",
